      "fontSize": 26.868661429200078,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "class item extends uvm_sequence_item;\n  rand bit[31:0] data;\n  rand integer array[];\n  rand integer array2[][];\n\n  `uvm_object_utils_begin(item)\n     `uvm_field_int(data, UVM_ALL_ON)\n     `uvm_field_array_int(array, UVM_ALL_ON)\n \n  static constraint cstr{\n    soft data == 1;\n    soft array.size() == 1;\n    soft data inside {[1:2], 3};\n    soft data inside array;\n    a == 1 -> soft data == 1;\n    ! (data inside {[1:2], 3});\n\n    data dist{0:= 20, [1:3]:=50}; \n    //0:1:2:3 = 20 : 50 : 50 : 50\n    data dist{0:/20, [1:3]:/50};  \n    //0:1:2:3 = 20 : 50/3 : 50/3 :50/3\n\n    if (data == 0) {array[0] < 10;}\n    else if (data == 1){array[0] > 100;}\n\n    data == 2 -> addr == 1;\n    unique{data, array[0], array[1]};\n\n    foreach(array[i])\n      array[i] == 1;\n    \n    array2.size() == 2;\n    foreach(array2[i])\n      array2[i].size() == 3;\n    \n    foreach(array[i, j]);\n\n    solve data before addr;\n    \n    array.sum with (int'(item)) == 50;\n    array.product with (int'(item)) == 50;    \n    array.and with (int'(item)) == 50; \n    array.or with (int'(item)) == 50; \n    array.xor with (int'(item)) == 50; \n\n    data == func();\n  }\n\n  a=0,1 / b=0-3\n  constraint c { (a == 0) -> (b == 1); }\n  //2x4=8 - 3 = 5 => 1/5\n\n  solve a before b\n  a=0,b=0 = 1/2*1\n  a=1,b=0 = 1/2*1/4",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "class item extends uvm_sequence_item;\n  rand bit[31:0] data;\n  rand integer array[];\n  rand integer array2[][];\n\n  `uvm_object_utils_begin(item)\n     `uvm_field_int(data, UVM_ALL_ON)\n     `uvm_field_array_int(array, UVM_ALL_ON)\n \n  static constraint cstr{\n    soft data == 1;\n    soft array.size() == 1;\n    soft data inside {[1:2], 3};\n    soft data inside array;\n    a == 1 -> soft data == 1;\n    ! (data inside {[1:2], 3});\n\n    data dist{0:= 20, [1:3]:=50}; \n    //0:1:2:3 = 20 : 50 : 50 : 50\n    data dist{0:/20, [1:3]:/50};  \n    //0:1:2:3 = 20 : 50/3 : 50/3 :50/3\n\n    if (data == 0) {array[0] < 10;}\n    else if (data == 1){array[0] > 100;}\n\n    data == 2 -> addr == 1;\n    unique{data, array[0], array[1]};\n\n    foreach(array[i])\n      array[i] == 1;\n    \n    array2.size() == 2;\n    foreach(array2[i])\n      array2[i].size() == 3;\n    \n    foreach(array[i, j]);\n\n    solve data before addr;\n    \n    array.sum with (int'(item)) == 50;\n    array.product with (int'(item)) == 50;    \n    array.and with (int'(item)) == 50; \n    array.or with (int'(item)) == 50; \n    array.xor with (int'(item)) == 50; \n\n    data == func();\n  }\n\n  a=0,1 / b=0-3\n  constraint c { (a == 0) -> (b == 1); }\n  //2x4=8 - 3 = 5 => 1/5\n\n  solve a before b\n  a=0,b=0 = 1/2*1\n  a=1,b=0 = 1/2*1/4",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
