      "updated": 1775704976377,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "how to verify a xxx block?\n\n\n\n\n\n    从小到大\n        模块级别验证：验证不同的输入输出(randomize/coverage) + coverage case => functional verification\n        模块连接到子系统: functional verification / connection verification(formal verification) / \n                                           stall verification(different interfaces have different speed) / CDC verification(functional+formal) \n                                            / performance&power verification\n        系统级别验证：c test verification / run real user case",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "how to verify a xxx block?\n\n\n\n\n\n    从小到大\n        模块级别验证：验证不同的输入输出(randomize/coverage) + coverage case => functional verification\n        模块连接到子系统: functional verification / connection verification(formal verification) / \n                                           stall verification(different interfaces have different speed) / CDC verification(functional+formal) \n                                            / performance&power verification\n        系统级别验证：c test verification / run real user case",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
